This privacy policy explains how Dartington Recreation Association (DRA), the charity behind Meadowbrook, collects and uses personal information.

## Who we are

Dartington Recreation Association is a registered charity (Charity number 1168817) based at Meadowbrook, Dartington, Devon.

## What information we collect

We collect personal information you provide when you contact us, subscribe to our mailing list, make a booking, or apply to volunteer or become a trustee. This may include your name, email address, and other contact details.

## How we use your information

We use your information to respond to enquiries, send updates you have subscribed to, and administer bookings and memberships. We will not share your information with third parties without your consent, except as required by law.

## Contact

If you have any questions about this policy or wish to have your data removed, please contact us.
